                <p><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US"><span>Chile </span><span>avanza</span><span> </span><span>hacia</span><span> </span><span>una</span><span> </span><span>matriz</span><span> </span><span>energética</span><span> </span><span>más</span><span> </span><span>sustentable</span><span>, con un sector </span><span>en</span><span> </span><span>expansión</span><span> y </span><span>regulaciones</span><span> que </span><span>fomentan</span><span> la </span><span>inversión</span><span>. </span><span>Conoce</span><span> </span><span>el</span><span> </span><span>sistema</span><span> </span><span>eléctrico</span><span>, sus </span><span>principales</span><span> </span><span>actores</span><span> y </span><span>oportunidades</span><span> </span><span>en</span><span> </span><span>generación</span><span>, </span><span>transmisión</span><span>, </span><span>distribución</span><span> e </span><span>hidrógeno</span><span> </span><span>verde</span><span>, con </span><span>apoyo</span><span> para </span><span>inversionistas</span><span> que </span><span>buscan</span><span> </span><span>impulsar</span><span> la </span><span>revolución</span><span> </span><span>renovable</span><span>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
