                <h2>The Energy Industry in Chile  </h2>
                <p><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US"><span>Chile is advancing toward a more sustainable energy matrix</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US"><span>, with a growing sector and regulations that promote investment. Learn about the electricity system, its key players, and opportunities in generation, transmission, distribution, and green hydrogen, with support available for investors looking to drive the renewable energy revolution. </span></span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
